  "fill": {
    "note": "A day is filled up to the session length, never over it, and ends at most bandMin minutes short unless it is already as big as the experience allows ('sets': at most maxExercises exercises, each at most 'max' sets; a beginner's long session can end shorter). Order: the template slots (only the first maxExercises), then each day's 'extras' in order, then one more set per row in turn (main lifts first) up to 'max', then sets again after any further extra. A day longer than the session is trimmed instead (accessory sets, then the last accessories, the main lifts last).",
    "bandMin": 10
  },
